<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ClinTrials started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ClinTrials started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it initiated coverage of ClinTrials Research Inc as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ClinTrials gained 1/4 to 10-1/2.</p>
